# ZL Warm for WebCLAP

ZLWarm by ZL Audio (zsliu98), a distortion/saturation plugin, ported to WebCLAP. This is not an official ZL Audio
release.

- ZLWarm: https://github.com/ZL-Audio/ZLWarm (commit 48093f3, after version 0.2.1)
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-zl-warm.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

Changes in this port (`patches/zl-warm-webclap.patch`): the processor builds without its editor. The meters run
while the page is open and cross over to it. The plugin has no window: openDAW's device panel (`ui/panel.html`) is
all of it.

